WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:32.166
In the earlier verses of Chapter 14,

2
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:36.166
Lord Krishna had described how
when sattva Guna is dominant,

3
00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:39.458
the senses are illuminated by knowledge

4
00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:41.000
and a person gains clarity

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.125
and discernment.

6
00:00:43.125 --> 00:00:46.625
Now in verse 14.12, He reveals

7
00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:49.041
what happens when Rajo Guna

8
00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:50.916
becomes dominant.

9
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:52.541
The nature of Rajo Guna

10
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:55.875
constantly arouses desires and binds a person

11
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:59.375
to the race for material achievements.

12
00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:00.666
Under its influence,

13
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:01.791
a person becomes absorbed

14
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:05.416
in gaining pleasures and success.

15
00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:07.375
One desire is fulfilled

16
00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:10.000
and immediately another is born,

17
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.250
then a third.

18
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.166
In this way a person keeps running,

19
00:01:14.166 --> 00:01:17.083
but is never satisfied.

20
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:26.083
Lord Krishna describes certain specific signs

21
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:27.583
of Rajo Guna’s dominance.

22
00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:31.291
The first is lobha – greed –

23
00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.958
the tendency of being unable to let go

24
00:01:32.958 --> 00:01:35.500
of what one has.

25
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:38.791
The second is pravritti –

26
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:43.458
constantly striving to acquire more and more.

27
00:01:43.458 --> 00:01:46.083
The third is arambha –

28
00:01:46.083 --> 00:01:50.333
the restlessness to keep starting new ventures.

29
00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:53.916
Along with these comes ashama spriha –

30
00:01:53.916 --> 00:01:58.750
desires that never settle.

31
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.250
Even after one goal is achieved,

32
00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:04.500
the mind immediately races toward the next.

33
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.750
In this state, a person

34
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.541
remains entangled in acquiring

35
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.250
and preserving material things.

36
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:14.208
The constant pursuit of wealth, respect,

37
00:02:14.208 --> 00:02:16.916
and pleasure keeps them perpetually restless.

38
00:02:16.916 --> 00:02:19.458
Outwardly this path appears to bring

39
00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:22.541
success and material achievement,

40
00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:25.375
but it does not give inner contentment.

41
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:27.666
A person keeps trying again and again,

42
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:28.791
but results

43
00:02:28.791 --> 00:02:31.833
only add to bondage.

44
00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:34.875
Thus Rajo Guna fills life with endless

45
00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:38.291
running and dissatisfaction.

46
00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.750
The true solution comes only

47
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.458
when a person recognises these signs,

48
00:02:43.458 --> 00:02:47.500
moves toward sattva Guna, and ultimately

49
00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.916
rises above all gunas through devotion
to Lord Krishna.

50
00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:01.166
You may feel that by chasing desires

51
00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:05.750
and fulfilling them, you are moving forward.

52
00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.083
But the truth is –

53
00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:10.250
you are not moving forward.

54
00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.416
You are only running in the same place.

55
00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:17.458
Rajo Guna keeps you busy –

56
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:21.333
always wanting something from you,

57
00:03:21.333 --> 00:03:23.583
always making you strive,

58
00:03:23.583 --> 00:03:26.708
never giving you rest.

59
00:03:26.708 --> 00:03:28.958
One goal is met

60
00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:31.791
and another appears before you.

61
00:03:31.791 --> 00:03:35.666
A promotion arrives – and the next
bigger position is desired.

62
00:03:35.666 --> 00:03:37.458
A new car is bought –

63
00:03:37.458 --> 00:03:40.875
and the mind races toward a bigger one.

64
00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:43.958
This guna makes you believe

65
00:03:43.958 --> 00:03:47.958
that happiness will come after the next goal –

66
00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:52.083
the next achievement, the next thing.

67
00:03:52.083 --> 00:03:56.083
But does it truly happen that way?

68
00:03:56.083 --> 00:03:59.125
When Rajo Guna dominates,

69
00:03:59.125 --> 00:04:02.291
there is no peace within.

70
00:04:02.291 --> 00:04:06.250
You begin to see speed itself as the point.

71
00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.958
More work, more plans –

72
00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:12.166
but the mind is restless within.

73
00:04:12.166 --> 00:04:14.125
The soul grows tired

74
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:17.625
and you do not even realise it.

75
00:04:17.625 --> 00:04:23.291
This is why I say – pause for a moment.

76
00:04:23.291 --> 00:04:27.833
See who is driving you –

77
00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:32.000
clarity or compulsion?

78
00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.791
When greed, restlessness,

79
00:04:34.791 --> 00:04:40.416
and the fear of losing relevance surround you,

80
00:04:40.416 --> 00:04:42.833
recognise –

81
00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:46.083
Rajo Guna is active.

82
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:47.833
This is the moment –

83
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:50.208
to step out of this race.

84
00:04:50.208 --> 00:04:54.958
Slow down and think.

85
00:04:54.958 --> 00:04:58.666
True freedom begins

86
00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:02.250
when you leave the blind race behind

87
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:05.875
and learn to see with awareness.

88
00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:10.000
When you give up the attachment to running,

89
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.541
only then is space created

90
00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:14.833
for real joy.

91
00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:16.250
Reflect on this.

92
00:05:20.833 --> 00:05:22.666
A person often feels

93
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:26.541
this way about their family –

94
00:05:26.541 --> 00:05:30.500
‘We must give our family more.

95
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:33.250
Better schools, a bigger home,

96
00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.208
enjoyable holidays and trips.’

97
00:05:36.208 --> 00:05:38.458
I see this – parents

98
00:05:38.458 --> 00:05:41.750
exhaust themselves thinking

99
00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:45.208
they are doing all this for the children.

100
00:05:45.208 --> 00:05:48.125
Husband and wife work even harder

101
00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:52.708
believing that more comfort
means more closeness.

102
00:05:52.708 --> 00:05:56.708
But in this race, the very people

103
00:05:56.708 --> 00:05:59.666
for whom all of this is being done get left behind.

104
00:05:59.666 --> 00:06:03.708
Rajo Guna whispers slowly in the ear –

105
00:06:03.708 --> 00:06:11.125
‘Just a little more, then happiness will come.’

106
00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:13.208
But the truth is –

107
00:06:13.208 --> 00:06:16.666
the more you chase the material,

108
00:06:16.666 --> 00:06:21.125
the emptier the heart becomes.

109
00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:24.416
When the mind is full of ambition,

110
00:06:24.416 --> 00:06:27.291
where is the space to listen?

111
00:06:27.291 --> 00:06:31.000
When the day is full of work,

112
00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.000
where is the sense of belonging?

113
00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.583
True family strength does not rest

114
00:06:36.583 --> 00:06:40.000
on how much wealth you have gathered.

115
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.250
It rests on how much time and affection

116
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:48.458
you have given your family.

117
00:06:48.458 --> 00:06:51.916
I want you to think –

118
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:54.958
are you building a home,

119
00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:57.833
or only laying bricks?

120
00:06:57.833 --> 00:07:00.666
Are your children growing up

121
00:07:00.666 --> 00:07:03.958
seeing your face,

122
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:09.083
or only seeing you work?

123
00:07:09.083 --> 00:07:12.833
Pause for a moment. Make space for stillness.

124
00:07:12.833 --> 00:07:16.875
Let contentment become your
family’s true wealth.

125
00:07:16.875 --> 00:07:20.458
When guidance comes from love alone,

126
00:07:20.458 --> 00:07:22.291
not ambition –

127
00:07:22.291 --> 00:07:24.208
only then do you realise

128
00:07:24.208 --> 00:07:27.541
how much you already have.

129
00:07:27.541 --> 00:07:30.500
When you move forward from love

130
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.375
rather than expectation,

131
00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:37.250
you understand that what you have

132
00:07:37.291 --> 00:07:38.958
is enough.

133
00:07:43.416 --> 00:07:48.708
In the beginning, being ambitious
feels excellent.

134
00:07:48.708 --> 00:07:50.541
You set goals,

135
00:07:50.541 --> 00:07:52.958
strive with full enthusiasm,

136
00:07:52.958 --> 00:07:56.000
and enjoy success.

137
00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.500
But when Rajo Guna becomes dominant,

138
00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.875
this same ambition slowly

139
00:08:03.875 --> 00:08:06.041
turns into a bondage.

140
00:08:06.041 --> 00:08:09.083
You stop asking –

141
00:08:09.083 --> 00:08:12.125
‘why do I want this?’

142
00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:14.750
You only keep running

143
00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:17.041
after the next target.

144
00:08:17.041 --> 00:08:19.333
This is the moment

145
00:08:19.333 --> 00:08:23.166
Rajo Guna grips you.

146
00:08:23.166 --> 00:08:26.250
Then you start measuring your worth

147
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.250
by each new achievement.

148
00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:33.125
And even when that achievement arrives,

149
00:08:33.125 --> 00:08:37.375
there is no peace –

150
00:08:37.375 --> 00:08:41.291
another destination stands before you.

151
00:08:41.291 --> 00:08:45.125
I have seen many leaders

152
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:47.958
caught in this cycle –

153
00:08:47.958 --> 00:08:51.708
the world honours them,

154
00:08:51.708 --> 00:08:55.833
but within they remain restless.

155
00:08:55.833 --> 00:09:00.083
Their achievements no longer serve growth,

156
00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:03.666
only ego.

157
00:09:03.666 --> 00:09:08.041
You meet a sales target

158
00:09:08.041 --> 00:09:09.750
and immediately double it,

159
00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.208
then make it four times.

160
00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:15.000
Financial gains certainly increase,

161
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.583
but the loss

162
00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:21.125
of mental peace grows alongside.

163
00:09:21.125 --> 00:09:22.291
Is this

164
00:09:22.291 --> 00:09:24.958
a good bargain?

165
00:09:24.958 --> 00:09:26.583
Never.

166
00:09:26.583 --> 00:09:29.250
So ask yourself –

167
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.208
is your ambition

168
00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:33.041
making you better,

169
00:09:33.041 --> 00:09:37.583
or only keeping you busy and scattered?

170
00:09:37.583 --> 00:09:41.583
When goals begin to feel

171
00:09:41.583 --> 00:09:44.291
like a burden rather than inspiration,

172
00:09:44.291 --> 00:09:47.458
it is time to stop.

173
00:09:47.458 --> 00:09:49.166
True leadership

174
00:09:49.166 --> 00:09:52.500
does not lie in endlessly climbing higher.

175
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:56.958
It lies in knowing when to be still.

176
00:09:56.958 --> 00:09:59.875
In remaining rooted

177
00:09:59.875 --> 00:10:02.291
while still reaching for heights.

178
00:10:02.291 --> 00:10:06.375
So be ambitious –

179
00:10:06.375 --> 00:10:09.833
but do not become blind to discernment.

180
00:10:09.833 --> 00:10:15.458
Keep only those goals that lift you –
not those that bind you.

181
00:10:15.458 --> 00:10:16.916
Such goals

182
00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:20.541
and this wise ambition

183
00:10:20.541 --> 00:10:24.250
will lead you toward true liberation.
